    "AI 去掉桌面，換上乾淨背景和陰影" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI swaps the table for a clean background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 去背中…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cutting out with AI…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 不蒐集任何個人資料，也不用註冊帳號。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app collects no personal data, and there’s no account to sign up for."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 內購（StoreKit）、相機、照片、Vision 與語音辨識都是 Apple 的系統功能，沒有使用第三方程式庫。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In-app purchase (StoreKit), camera, Photos, Vision, and speech recognition are Apple system frameworks. No third-party code libraries are used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 內附的字型為了縮小檔案只保留常用字，依 OFL 授權修改與散布。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To keep the app small, the bundled fonts are subset to common characters, as the OFL permits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 支援繁體中文和英文，預設跟隨 iPhone 的語言。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app is in Traditional Chinese and English, and follows your iPhone’s language by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
